<title>SPAIN: Aragonesas H1 net profit 1.362 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Aragonesas H1 net profit 1.362 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for first half in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit			 2.020     vs     4.159</p>
<p> Net taxed				1.362     vs     3.617</p>
<p> Turnover				22.282     vs    26.365</p>
<p> Operating result		     2.007     vs     5.138</p>
<p> Ordinary results		     1.978     vs     4.557</p>
<p> Provisions			     0.871     vs     2.751</p>
<p> Fixed assets			  23.418     vs    24.243</p>
<p> Current assets			19.991     vs    20.079</p>
<p>NOTE- Energia e Industriales Aragonesas EIA SA said net profit was 139 million in the first quarter but increased to 1.223 billion in the second quarter. The improvement was due to a rise in sales, an improvement in PVC prices and lower energy costs, due to investments and better electricity prices.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2161</p>
</text>
